{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06586","headline":"河中望鸟滩作贻吕四郎中 · 储光羲","name":"河中望鸟滩作贻吕四郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河流有深曲，舟子莫能知。\n弭棹临沙屿，微吟西日驰。\n平明春色霁，两岸好风吹。\n去去川途尽，悠悠亲友离。\n汉宫成羽翼，伊水弄参差。\n爲惜淮南子，如何攀桂枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}